diting.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact contains a single Markdown skill file, declares no required binaries, and includes no bundled executable code or dependency installer.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill gives procedural guidance for inspecting and editing presentations; related skill installation is explicitly gated on user confirmation.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No artifact evidence shows credential use, privilege escalation, background workers, persistent memory changes, services, hooks, or automatic system modification.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is creating, inspecting, and editing PPTX decks, and the instructions stay focused on deck structure, templates, placeholders, notes, charts, and visual QA.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this when you want help working with PowerPoint files. Be aware that effective deck review may involve reading visible slides plus notes, comments, media, and linked assets, so use appropriate care with confidential presentations.","findings":"[EA2] expected: The cited phrase appears in a warning that combining or duplicating slides without checking masters and themes can cause inconsistencies; it is not an instruction to make autonomous high-impact decisions or bypass user confirmation.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no security findings, which matches the inspected artifact's Markdown-only, presentation-focused behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789074783779}}}}}